# COMPONENT

## TextusSupervisor

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.supervisor

### DESCRIPTION

Lifecycle authority component for managed Textus deployments. The Supervisor
Service is the executable component boundary and also provides the CNCF
standard `Supervisor` SPI.

### SERVICE

#### Supervisor

- spi-standard :: cncf.supervisor
- spi-direction :: provides
- spi-socket :: false

# SERVICE

## Supervisor

### DESCRIPTION

Protected lifecycle command and lookup operations. The CNCF Supervisor SPI
provider delegates to this Service so local and remote placements share the
same executable semantics.

### OPERATION

#### submit

- type :: COMMAND
- input :: SupervisorRequest
- output :: SupervisorResult

##### DESCRIPTION

Submits one idempotent lifecycle request to the Supervisor Service. The request
contains no process identifier, shell command, filesystem locator, or
credential.

##### VISIBILITY

protected

#### lookup

- type :: QUERY
- input :: SupervisorLookup
- output :: SupervisorLookupResult

##### DESCRIPTION

Looks up the durable result for one Supervisor request ID without creating or
controlling a deployment.

##### VISIBILITY

protected

# VALUE

## SupervisorRequest

- input-kind :: COMMAND

### DESCRIPTION

Component operation projection of the CNCF Supervisor request contract.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name              | type    | multiplicity |
|-------------------+---------+--------------|
| requestId         | string  | 1            |
| idempotencyKey    | string  | 1            |
| targetId          | string  | 1            |
| deploymentId      | string  | ?            |
| action            | string  | 1            |
| operatorSubjectId | string  | 1            |
| deadlineAt        | instant | 1            |

## SupervisorResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### DESCRIPTION

Component operation projection of the CNCF Supervisor result contract.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name           | type    | multiplicity |
|----------------+---------+--------------|
| requestId      | string  | 1            |
| state          | string  | 1            |
| diagnosticCode | string  | ?            |
| diagnostic     | string  | ?            |
| supervisorId   | string  | 1            |
| instanceId     | string  | ?            |
| acceptedAt     | instant | ?            |
| completedAt    | instant | ?            |

## SupervisorLookup

- input-kind :: QUERY

### DESCRIPTION

Request to look up one durable Supervisor request.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name      | type   | multiplicity |
|-----------+--------+--------------|
| requestId | string | 1            |

## SupervisorLookupResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### DESCRIPTION

Lookup result. `result` is absent when the durable request is unknown.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type             | multiplicity |
|--------+------------------+--------------|
| result | SupervisorResult | ?            |
